+
+## Props
+
+### `children`
+
+Text to display inside the badge.
+
+ - Type: `string`
+ - Required: Yes
+
+### `intent`
+
+Badge variant.
+
+ - Type: `"default" | "info" | "success" | "warning" | "error"`
+ - Required: No
+ - Default: `default`
